  "format_version": 1,
  "kernel": "flows",
  "notes": "200 DF 17 frames (CA 5, random address and ME, CRC-24 parity) at 2 MHz in 150000 cu8 samples; pulses of one sample at p, p + 2, p + 7, p + 9 and p + 16 + 2 k (bit 1) or p + 17 + 2 k (bit 0); amplitudes 10 to 30 dB above the noise (A^2 / (2 sigma^2), uniform in dB), random carrier phase, offset up to 100 kHz; noise sigma 0.018 per component, 40 bursts of 32 to 1024 samples 0 to 12 dB above it; frames lists index (= p), the 14 bytes, the address, level_db and snr_db (over the noise plus the strongest burst overlapping p - 256 .. p + 240); every frame with snr_db above min_snr_db must decode with CRC_OK at its index, and no other CRC_OK frame may appear",
